            "notes": "I like going with  [Maxed Mag](item_e73221bc-1197-4034-b122-fe3feb2d2292)  and p [Greased Loader](item_0ee48089-49a3-4980-a6f6-3d4b72585ead)  here to really turn up the heat and put pressure at a distance. You only need about a 1-2 second window and you can either 2 shot or 3 shot a DPS or Support depending on headshots. \n\nI flex  [Stacked Sticks](item_2ad5dace-ac3c-43fe-b20b-3add489a7207)  if I feel like the enemy tank is particularly vulnerable(no shields/poor heals) and doesn't have a means of fire extinguishing to help my tank keep the pressure on.",
